<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cimraan Books | Buugaag & Xirfado</title>
  <style>
:root{
  --bg:#07111f;
  --surface:#0d1b2e;
  --surface2:#10243c;
  --text:#f4f8ff;
  --muted:#a9b8ca;
  --primary:#5eead4;
  --primary2:#38bdf8;
  --gold:#fbbf24;
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  --shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(56,189,248,.14),transparent 28%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(94,234,212,.10),transparent 25%),
    var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;
}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.hero{min-height:72vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:before{
  content:"";position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;
  right:-120px;top:-160px;background:rgba(94,234,212,.12);filter:blur(10px)
}
nav{
  width:min(1120px,92%);margin:0 auto;padding:26px 0;display:flex;
  align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;z-index:2
}
.logo{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.03em}
nav a{color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;transition:.2s}
nav a:hover{color:var(--primary)}
.hero-content{
  width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;text-align:center;padding:55px 0 90px;position:relative;z-index:1
}
.tag{color:var(--primary);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,7vw,5.5rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin-bottom:24px}
.hero-content>p:not(.tag){max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem}
.btn,.book-info button{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;cursor:pointer;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary2));color:#04121e;
  font-weight:900;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(56,189,248,.20);
  transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s
}
.btn:hover,.book-info button:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 38px rgba(56,189,248,.28)}
.container{width:min(1120px,92%);margin:0 auto;padding:80px 0}
.container h2,.contact h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);letter-spacing:-.04em}
.intro{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 36px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.book-card{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.055),rgba(255,255,255,.025));
  border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s
}
.book-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);border-color:rgba(94,234,212,.35)}
.cover{
  min-height:250px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:.04em;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b3b55,#10213b)
}
.cover span{color:var(--primary);font-size:1.35rem}
.cover small{margin-top:16px;font-size:.75rem;color:#cbd5e1;letter-spacing:.2em}
.cover.alt{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#153b3b,#15233d)}
.cover.alt span{color:#5eead4}
.cover.third{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#3a2c18,#17223b)}
.cover.third span{color:var(--gold)}
.book-info{padding:24px}
.book-info h3{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.book-info p{color:var(--muted);min-height:52px}
.price{font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:950;margin:18px 0;color:var(--gold)}
.book-info button{width:100%}
.contact{
  width:min(1120px,92%);margin:0 auto 70px;padding:50px;border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:28px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(94,234,212,.08),rgba(56,189,248,.06))
}
.contact p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 24px}
.whatsapp{display:inline-flex;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:14px;background:#25D366;color:#05220e;font-weight:900}
footer{text-align:center;padding:28px;color:#74859a;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.9rem}
@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero{min-height:65vh}}
@media(max-width:560px){
  nav{padding:20px 0}.logo{font-size:1.05rem}
  .hero-content{padding:35px 0 65px}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .container{padding:60px 0}
  .cover{min-height:220px}
  .contact{padding:34px 20px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">📚 Cimraan Books</div>
      <a href="#books">Buugaagta</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="tag">BUUGAG • AQOON • XIRFADO</p>
      <h1>Ku soo dhowow Cimraan Books</h1>
      <p>Halkan ka dooro buugga aad rabto, kadib WhatsApp noogu soo dir dalabkaaga.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#books">Eeg Buugaagta</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="books" class="container">
    <h2>Buugaagta La Heli Karo</h2>
    <p class="intro">Dooro buug, eeg qiimaha, kadib guji “Dalbo WhatsApp”.</p>

    <section class="grid">
      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="cover">FOREX<br><span>TRADING</span><small>2026</small></div>
        <div class="book-info">
          <h3>Barashada Forex Trading</h3>
          <p>Buug bilow ah oo sharxaya aasaaska Forex Trading.</p>
          <div class="price">$75</div>
          <button onclick="orderBook('Barashada Forex Trading', '$75')">Dalbo WhatsApp</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="cover alt">DIGITAL<br><span>SKILLS</span><small>2026</small></div>
        <div class="book-info">
          <h3>Digital Skills</h3>
          <p>Baro xirfadaha muhiimka ah ee digital-ka iyo shaqada online-ka.</p>
          <div class="price">$35</div>
          <button onclick="orderBook('Digital Skills', '$35')">Dalbo WhatsApp</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="cover third">MARKETING<br><span>SKILLS</span><small>2026</small></div>
        <div class="book-info">
          <h3>Marketing Skills</h3>
          <p>Casharro ku saabsan aasaaska marketing-ka iyo kobcinta ganacsiga.</p>
          <div class="price">$35</div>
          <button onclick="orderBook('Marketing Skills', '$35')">Dalbo WhatsApp</button>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <section class="contact">
    <h2>Dalab & Xiriir</h2>
    <p>Haddii aad rabto buug, WhatsApp nagala soo xiriir.</p>
    <a class="whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/252619754584" target="_blank">💬 WhatsApp: 0619754584</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Cimraan Books — Dhammaan xuquuqdu way dhowran yihiin.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
function orderBook(book, price){
  const phone = "252619754584";
  const message = `Salaan Cimraan Books 👋%0A%0AWaxaan rabaa inaan dalbado:%0A📚 ${book}%0A💰 Qiime: ${price}%0A%0AFadlan iga caawi dalabka. Mahadsanid.`;
  window.open(`https://wa.me/${phone}?text=${message}`, "_blank");
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
